Order Completed

<% if @user == @order.user %>
Hello <%= @user.first_name || @user.email %>,

Your order has been successfully completed. Thank you for using Kara Bloome!
<% else %>
A order has been completed.
<% end %>

Order Details:
- Order ID: #<%= @order.id.to_s.first(8) %>
- Product: <%= @product&.name || "N/A" %>
- Total: <%= number_to_currency(@order.total_price) %>

Completed Items:
<% items_to_show = @fulfillment ? @order_items : @order.order_items.includes(variant_stock: { variant_options: :images }) %>
<% items_to_show.each do |item| %>
- <%= item.variant_stock_option_names || "Item" %>
  Quantity: <%= item.quantity %>
  Price: <%= number_to_currency(item.price) %>
  <% if item.variant_stock_warehouse_name %>Warehouse: <%= item.variant_stock_warehouse_name %><% end %>
<% end %>

<% if @user == @order.user %>
We hope you enjoyed your order experience. We'd love to hear your feedback!
<% else %>
All items have been returned and processed successfully.
<% end %>

View your order: <%= @order_url %>

Best regards,
The Kara Bloome Team
